# Submissions are configured in .env.development (testing) and .env.production (live site).
# Set ONE of:
#   VITE_SUBMIT_EMAIL=someone@example.com
#   VITE_SUBMIT_ENDPOINT=https://formsubmit.co/ajax/your-random-string   (or a Formspree URL)
# To override either one on your own machine without committing it, use .env.development.local
# or .env.production.local.
